  "title": "Apfelkuchen (Apple Cake)",
  "description": "This German apfelkuchen dessert uses a yeasted dough but only needs 30 minutes to rise. It&#39;s a moist and subtly sweet cake, making it perfect for an afternoon treat.",
  "authors": [
    "Adrienne Gardner"
  ],
